    "status": "DEGENERATE",
    "caveat": "acc10_hit is a constant (all 0) across all 36 items -- every single item misses the 10% tolerance, matching E2's Acc@10%=0.0 finding. Correlation with a zero-variance variable is mathematically undefined (NaN), not 'zero' or 'no correlation' -- there is no accuracy signal to decouple FROM at this threshold."
